# Particle simulation sweep. DESTRUCTION_PLAN.md phase 6's gate needs the cost
# of the CPU sim at the counts the game actually reaches, and rule 11 says
# sweep the axis before building anything.
#
# No explosions: the level stands and the debris is injected directly, so the
# only thing being measured is the per-particle step.
size 192 96 192
chunk 64 96 64
level towers
particles 160000
ticks 200
spawn 4 5000
